@startuml UC-41
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-41.md
title UC-41: Write Review
footer Feature REV-01 | Business rules: BR-08, BR-37, BR-38
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "ReviewsController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ReviewService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Click "Review" on an item of a completed order,\nenter rating and comment
MVC -> API : POST /api/reviews { orderItemId, rating, comment }
API -> SVC : CreateAsync(currentUserId, request)
SVC -> SVC : Validate rating 1..5, comment <= 1000 characters (BR-37)
alt invalid input
  SVC --> API : ValidationException
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
  MVC --> U : Show errors
else valid
  SVC -> DB : Load order item + order + variant
  alt not found or order owned by another user (BR-08)
    SVC --> API : NotFound
    API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
    MVC --> U : Show "Order item not found"
  else OrderStatus is not Completed
    SVC --> API : Conflict
    API --> MVC : 409 Conflict
    MVC --> U : Show "You can review after the order is completed"
  else item already reviewed
    SVC --> API : Conflict
    API --> MVC : 409 Conflict
    MVC --> U : Show "You have already reviewed this item"
  else eligible
    group transaction
      SVC -> DB : Insert Review (UserId = order.UserId,\nProductId = variant.ProductId, OrderItemId,\nRating, Comment, IsVisible = 1)
      SVC -> DB : Recalculate AverageRating, ReviewCount\nfrom visible reviews (BR-38)
      SVC -> DB : SaveChangesAsync + COMMIT
    end
    SVC --> API : ReviewDto
    API --> MVC : 201 Created
    MVC --> U : Show review on the order item
  end
end

@enduml
